(1. Purpose and Scope) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
(This policy governs every purchase of production material by Harbor Fabrication Co. It) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
(applies to all buyers, planners and automated purchasing tools.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
() Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
