(2. Approved Supplier List) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
(Production material may only be bought from suppliers on the Approved Supplier List \(ASL\).) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
(Suppliers struck from the Approved Supplier List must not be used for any reason, including) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
(urgent need.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
