(2.1 Certification) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
(Suppliers of electronic components, circuit boards and safety-related parts must hold a) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
(current ISO-9001 certificate. Suppliers of power conversion components \(DC link capacitor) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
(packs, choke cores\) must also hold IEC-62368 certification.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
() Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
() Tj T*
