(3. Country of Origin) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
(Harbor Fabrication Co. buys from domestic \(United States and Mexico\) suppliers by) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
(preference. An international supplier may be chosen only if: \(a\) no domestic supplier can) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
(deliver by the date required, \(b\) the domestic price is more than 30% above the) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
(international price, or \(c\) no domestic source offers the part. For critical parts \(Section) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
(4\) the price test in \(b\) uses 45% instead of 30%.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
() Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
() Tj T*
