(4. Critical Parts) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
(The following are critical parts: motor controller ICs, IGBT power modules, circuit boards,) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
(samarium-cobalt magnets, and all sensing ICs and transducers \(flow, level, salinity\). Each) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
(critical part should have at least two qualified suppliers.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
() Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
() Tj T*
/F2 10 Tf
(5. Supplier Diversification) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
(No single supplier may provide more than 65% of the units of any critical part bought in a) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
(rolling 12-month window, or more than 80% for any other part. A part available from only one) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
(supplier requires a Sole Source Justification on file.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
() Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
() Tj T*
/F2 10 Tf
